# Allow-list build context (design 16 section 4.8): only what the image build reads. A new top-level directory needs a line here
# on purpose; nothing else (.git, .github, docs, testdata, tools, node_modules, dist, bin, local config, .env files) is sent to the daemon.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!web/
!LICENSE
# inside the allowed directories
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/e2e
web/playwright-report
**/*_test.go
**/testdata
**/.DS_Store
